27866fad [gemini-3.8-flash] #
27866fad [gemini-3.8-flash] #2. Verify with FFmpeg
27866fad [gemini-3.8-flash] #If you have `ffmpeg` installed with DeckLink support enabled (the default Arch package typically
27866fad [gemini-3.8-flash] #includes this), you can list all detected Blackmagic input devices:
