279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #                 │        COGNATION          │
279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #                 │   The Interactive Engine  │
279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #                 └─────────────┬─────────────┘
279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #                               │
279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #               ┌───────────────┴───────────────┐
279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #               ▼                               ▼
279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #       ┌───────────────┐               ┌───────────────┐
279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #       │     THINK     │ ◄───────────► │     EDIT      │
279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #       │ Reasoning     │   Live Shared │ Direct Screen │
279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #       │ Tools & Model │     Buffer    │ Buffer Canvas │
279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #       │ Multi-Account │    Context    │ Instant Keys  │
279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #       └───────────────┘               └───────────────┘
279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #Core Tenets of the Project
279e1842 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
279e1843 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Symmetric Primacy: Neither tool is subordinate. `think` isn't just an extension panel
279e1843 [gemini-3.8-flash] #tacked onto an editor, and `edit` isn't just an external process spawned from a prompt. They are
279e1843 [gemini-3.8-flash] #two coordinated modes of inspecting and manipulating code.
279e1843 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Direct Manipulation: Following the BlitzMax / MaxIDE philosophy—no framework bloat,
279e1843 [gemini-3.8-flash] #immediate startup, deterministic raw-mode terminal rendering, and zero latency between keystroke
279e1843 [gemini-3.8-flash] #and pixel update.
279e1843 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Continuous Context: When you switch between `think` and `edit`, the active file, cursor
279e1843 [gemini-3.8-flash] #position, selected lines, and recent git/forge diffs are preserved without needing serialization or
279e1843 [gemini-3.8-flash] #disk-roundtripping.
279e1843 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
279e1843 [gemini-3.8-flash] #It creates a clear conceptual identity: Cognation as the project and runtime, with `think`
279e1843 [gemini-3.8-flash] #and `edit` as its primary instruments.
279e1843 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
