279f094f [gemini-3.8-flash] #Standalone Binary Alternative
279f094f [gemini-3.8-flash] #
279f094f [gemini-3.8-flash] #If you prefer to avoid Flatpak's sandboxing (which can sometimes complicate accessing files outside
279f094f [gemini-3.8-flash] #your home directory), official standalone Linux binaries are single executables that require no
