28b25d8b [gemini-3.8-flash] #
28b25d8b [gemini-3.8-flash] #Why the Menu Bar / "About" is Missing
28b25d8b [gemini-3.8-flash] #
28b25d8b [gemini-3.8-flash] #In modern KDE Konsole releases, the traditional menu bar is frequently hidden by default.
28b25d8b [gemini-3.8-flash] #
28b25d8b [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Toggle the Menu Bar: Press `Ctrl + Shift + M`. This toggles the top menu bar
28b25d8b [gemini-3.8-flash] #(File, Edit, View, Settings, Help/About) on and off.
28b25d8b [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Alternatively, right-click anywhere inside the terminal window to open the context menu, or look
28b25d8b [gemini-3.8-flash] #for the hamburger menu button (three horizontal lines) in the upper-right corner of the window.
28b25d8b [gemini-3.8-flash] #
28b25d8b [gemini-3.8-flash] #━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
28b25d8b [gemini-3.8-flash] #
28b25d8b [gemini-3.8-flash] #How to Change the Color Scheme in Konsole
28b25d8b [gemini-3.8-flash] #
28b25d8b [gemini-3.8-flash] #Once the menu or settings are visible:
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #1. Using the Menu Bar:
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #   * Go to Settings → Configure Konsole... (or right-click → Configure
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #Konsole...).
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #   * Select Profiles on the left sidebar.
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #   * Select your active profile (usually marked with a checkmark) and click Edit.
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #   * Switch to the Appearance tab.
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #   * Choose an existing color scheme from the list, or click Get New... to download
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #additional community themes.
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #   * Click Apply and OK.
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #2. From the Configuration Files Directly:
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #   * Konsole profile definitions are stored under `~/.local/share/konsole/` (ending in `.profile`).
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #   * Color schemes are stored as `.colorscheme` files in `/usr/share/konsole/` and
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #`~/.local/share/konsole/`.
28b25d8c [gemini-3.8-flash] #
