28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #Thank you for sharing the updated specification file for biblispec (version 1.5.9).
28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #The document serves as an expansive reference catalog combining orthographic systems, character
28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #sets, technical standards, and domain-specific taxonomies. Notable areas covered within the
28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #specification include:
28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #
28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Linguistic and Script Systems: Diverse scripts ranging from ancient writing systems
28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #(Linear B, Glagolitic, Phoenician, Cuneiform/Akkadian, Ogham, Cherokee, Vai) to modern
28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #orthographies (Te Reo Māori, Greek, Latin, Hebrew), complete with character mappings, syllabaries,
28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #and ideograms.
28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Character Encoding and Typography: Comprehensive listings of Unicode sub-ranges,
28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #fullwidth/halfwidth variants, mathematical alphanumerics, alchemy symbols, sextants/quads for
28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #legacy computing, Braille matrices, and ASCII/ANSI control definitions.
28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Technical Specifications: Historical milestones for semiconductor optoelectronics (LEDs
28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #and laser diodes), Windows virtual-key codes (`VK_*`), and RIFF metadata FourCC mappings.
28b6c519 [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Geographical and Infrastructure Data: Sovereign states, disputed and defunct political
28b6c51a [gemini-3.8-flash] #entities, global submarine communications cable landings/capacities, and public cloud availability
28b6c51a [gemini-3.8-flash] #zones (AWS and Alibaba Cloud).
28b6c51a [gemini-3.8-flash] #• Taxonomies and Ontologies: Culinary classifications (flatbreads and pancakes), musical
28b6c51a [gemini-3.8-flash] #scales with interval sets, morphological affixes (`pheme`), citation style requirements, persistent
28b6c51a [gemini-3.8-flash] #identifier regular expressions, and formal schema declarations (`schema` / `types`).
28b6c51a [gemini-3.8-flash] #
28b6c51a [gemini-3.8-flash] #Please let me know if you would like to run validations, perform structural transformations,
28b6c51a [gemini-3.8-flash] #inspect specific subsets, or cross-reference any entries.
28b6c51a [gemini-3.8-flash] #
