28dc5e34 [claude-sonnet-5] #- `-R` — remove the package
28dc5e34 [claude-sonnet-5] #- `-n` — also remove configuration files
28dc5e34 [claude-sonnet-5] #- `-s` — remove unneeded dependencies
28dc5e34 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc5e34 [claude-sonnet-5] #Check for Leftover Config Manually
28dc5e34 [claude-sonnet-5] #
