28dc8fee [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc8fee [claude-sonnet-5] #Add or edit under `[Default Applications]`:
28dc8fee [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc8fee [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc8fee [claude-sonnet-5] #image/png=feh.desktop
28dc8fee [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc8fee [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc8fee [claude-sonnet-5] #If you want all image types to change, not just PNG
