28dc9e49 [claude-sonnet-5] #Splash Screens — Two Different Things
28dc9e49 [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dc9e49 [claude-sonnet-5] #1. Plasma Login/Startup Splash Screen
28dc9e49 [claude-sonnet-5] #This is the animated logo that appears briefly when you log into Plasma (before your desktop
28dc9e49 [claude-sonnet-5] #loads).
28dc9e49 [claude-sonnet-5] #
