28dcf660 [claude-sonnet-5] #Are you planning to do the actual `drawImage`/pixel manipulation inside the worker (via
28dcf660 [claude-sonnet-5] #`OffscreenCanvas`), or just fetch/decode there and send bitmaps back to the main thread for
28dcf660 [claude-sonnet-5] #drawing?
28dcf660 [claude-sonnet-5] #
