28dd555b [claude-sonnet-5] #• bunny.net = "rabbit" — that's your CDN. This confirms the setup from earlier: Nginx
28dd555b [claude-sonnet-5] #(with the `/aerialgrid/` block we already looked at) sits behind Bunny CDN, which is what
28dd555b [claude-sonnet-5] #Discord/browsers actually hit first. This matters for the tainted-canvas diagnosis — if Bunny
28dd555b [claude-sonnet-5] #caches responses, it can also cache away* your CORS headers the same way we discussed,
28dd555b [claude-sonnet-5] #independent of what Nginx sends. Worth running:
28dd555b [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dd555b [claude-sonnet-5] #
