28dd555b [claude-sonnet-5] #curl -I https://skid.nz/aerialgrid/example.jpg
28dd555b [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dd555b [claude-sonnet-5] #
28dd555b [claude-sonnet-5] #If the CORS header is present on one but not the other, that tells you definitively whether Bunny
28dd555b [claude-sonnet-5] #or Nginx is the point of failure.
