28dd555c [claude-sonnet-5] #`aerialgrid`, `sd-aerialgrid`). Since Bunny is now confirmed as the CDN layer, this is worth adding
28dd555c [claude-sonnet-5] #across all four, not just `aerialgrid`, if any of them serve images destined for canvas use.
28dd555c [claude-sonnet-5] #- `roagrid2` / `topogrid2` don't have `sendfile`/`tcp_nopush`/`gzip_static` matching
