28ddd88c [claude-sonnet-5] #There's no `onBuild` function defined anywhere in the file — only `onBuildTopo(plan)` and
28ddd88c [claude-sonnet-5] #`onBuildCount(count)` exist, and neither is called `onBuild`. If a `"build"` command message is
28ddd88c [claude-sonnet-5] #ever actually posted to this worker, it'll throw `ReferenceError: onBuild is not defined`.
28ddd88c [claude-sonnet-5] #Currently dormant since nothing seems to send that command yet, but worth fixing or removing before
28ddd88c [claude-sonnet-5] #it's wired up.
28ddd88c [claude-sonnet-5] #
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #Dead Code Worth Pruning (Not Bugs, Just Clutter)
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #- `nitro-wire.js`: `loadScripts()` and the `wireScripts` array build a dynamic `<script>`
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #injection system, but it's never called — `initWire()` calls `initWireGrid(wireBody)` directly, and
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #`dspmap.html` already lists every `wire_*.js` as a static `<script src=...>` tag. This loader
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #appears fully superseded.
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #- `nitrogui.js`: `addButton2` duplicates `addButton`/`rawButton` almost exactly — looks
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #like an earlier draft left behind after refactoring into the `rawButton` helper.
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #Everything Else — Looks Solid
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #- `nitromarkup.js` — the markdown-to-HTML converter (tables, code fences, LaTeX via KaTeX, embeds
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #for image/audio/video/pdf/youtube) is comprehensive; only oddity is a harmless unreachable `return
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #text;` at the end of `escapeChars` (the `while(true)` loop always returns from inside).
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #- `nitrovectorfont.js`, `nitrolsystem.js`, `nitroshape.js`, `nitrostorage.js` — straightforward,
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #nothing jumped out.
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #- `worker_fetch.js`, `worker_post.js` — minimal worker stubs, consistent with the "simon come here"
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #WIP style seen elsewhere in the codebase.
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #
28ddd88d [claude-sonnet-5] #━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
