29066321 [skid@archlinux] Account for Windows Defender/SmartScreen reputation.
290663c0 [gpt-5.6-sol] #🟠nitrologic Relay 2.0.4 gpt-5.6-sol 🌀 🪠 🧊 $0.042 27.28KB 9.37s
290663c0 [gpt-5.6-sol] #This means Windows may warn users when they download or run a new, uncommon installer—even when it
290663c0 [gpt-5.6-sol] #is harmless.
290663c0 [gpt-5.6-sol] #
290663c0 [gpt-5.6-sol] #Typical warning:
290663c0 [gpt-5.6-sol] #
290663c0 [gpt-5.6-sol] #	icrosoft Defender SmartScreen prevented an unrecognized app from starting.
290663c0 [gpt-5.6-sol] #
290663c0 [gpt-5.6-sol] #SmartScreen considers factors such as the file’s digital signature, download prevalence, history,
290663c0 [gpt-5.6-sol] #and whether the file or signing identity is known to Microsoft.
290663c0 [gpt-5.6-sol] #
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #What to do
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #- Authenticode-sign every `.exe`, `.msi`, DLL, and installer with a trusted code-signing
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #certificate.
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #- Keep the same certificate/signing identity across releases so reputation can accumulate.
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #- Use stable filenames, publishers, domains, and download URLs.
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #- Serve downloads over HTTPS.
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #- Timestamp signatures so they remain valid after the certificate expires.
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #- Avoid packers, obfuscators, unexpected PowerShell actions, and unnecessary privilege elevation.
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #- Submit false detections or incorrectly blocked files through Microsoft’s security intelligence
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #submission portal.
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #- Publish SHA-256 checksums so users can verify downloads.
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #- Do not instruct ordinary users to disable Defender.
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #Check an Authenticode signature from PowerShell:
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #Get-AuthenticodeSignature .\YourInstaller.exe
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #A newly issued certificate or low-download release may still initially receive “unrecognized app”
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #warnings. Signing proves the publisher and protects file integrity; it does not automatically
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #guarantee an established SmartScreen reputation.
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #Also distinguish:
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #- Microsoft Defender Antivirus: scans for malware or suspicious behaviour.
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #- Microsoft Defender SmartScreen: warns about unrecognized or low-reputation downloads and
290663c1 [gpt-5.6-sol] #applications.
