298700d2 [kimi-k3] #- Seams between tiles → terrain alpha `O=0.94` forcing blend; make it opaque.
298700d3 [kimi-k3] #- Far tile painting over near → depth/culling problem, not order.
298700d3 [kimi-k3] #- Flora blending wrong when panning → needs back-to-front sort in the draw path, not at mesh time.
298700d3 [kimi-k3] #
298700d3 [kimi-k3] #Carried-over loose ends
