299cb902 [deepseek-flash] #16× fewer samples, so the worker flora pass is much cheaper. Fine as a knob; just note it's now
299cb902 [deepseek-flash] #lower resolution than the main-thread attempt (which is `256,8`).
299cb902 [deepseek-flash] #
299cb903 [deepseek-flash] #Suggested order
299cb903 [deepseek-flash] #
299cb903 [deepseek-flash] #1. Ungate `refresh` so tiles load again (or wire the sender).
299cb903 [deepseek-flash] #2. Pick one flora generator and delete the other. If worker: `postFlora` colour via `FloraPen` (set
