29a237d0 [deepseek-flash] #
29a237d0 [deepseek-flash] #
29a237d0 [deepseek-flash] #Two consequences:
29a237d0 [deepseek-flash] #
29a237d0 [deepseek-flash] #- Base no longer follows the dig. `pickGround` returns the dug depth when `ground[i]` is
29a237d0 [deepseek-flash] #set; `pickElevation` ignores it. So walls sit at terrain level and the basement carves below them —
