29a2dcae [deepseek-flash] #load-completion order. Fetch priority is `1-(aa+bb)` sorted ascending then popped from the
29a2dcae [deepseek-flash] #end, so the nearest tiles fetch first and mesh first. Net: roughly nearest-first, i.e.
29a2dcae [deepseek-flash] #front-to-back. Not deliberate, just a consequence.
